<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
  <title>Farmers</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/WAF_Deny_Page/failover_files/style.css">
</head>

<body class="major-error">
  <header class="error-header">
    <div class="ish-content">
      <img src="/WAF_Deny_Page/failover_files/logo.png" />
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="ish-content row-fluid f">
    <div class="col left">
      <h1>Farmers.co.nz is temporarily down</h1>
      <p>We are working to get it back up as quickly as possible. Please try again soon, or contact us with the details
        below.</p>
      <p>Error code:&#32;&#35;18&#46;565d3a17&#46;1784227869&#46;1252b142</p>
      <div class="ish-contact-us">
        <div class="contact-us-right-content">
          <div class="contact-us-call-center">
            <p><strong>Customer Service Team</strong></p>
            <p>Email us at <a
                href="mailto:contactus@farmers.co.nz?subject=Farmers%20Website%20Error:&#32;&#35;18&#46;565d3a17&#46;1784227869&#46;1252b142">contactus@farmers.co.nz</a>
            </p>
            <p>Toll-free: <a href="tel:0800 327 637">0800 327 637</a><br>International: <a href="+649272 6996">+64 9 272
                6996</a><br>
            <p>
              Monday-Friday* | 7:00AM-6:00PM<br>
              Saturday* | 9:00AM-1:00PM<br>
              Sunday | Closed<br>
            </p>

            <p>*Public Holidays | 9:00AM-5:30PM</p>

            <p>Closed on Good Friday, Easter Sunday and Christmas Day<br>
              ANZAC Day: 1pm to 6pm</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col right">
      <div class="row-fluid hidden-phone" style="height: 50px;">&nbsp;</div>
      <img src="/WAF_Deny_Page/failover_files/404_Panel_470x322.jpg" class="error-img"
        alt="Cartoon of the Farmers Toy Sale monster eating network cables">
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>